`express.json()` parses JSON bodies; without it `req.body` is undefined. Add a `/sihat` endpoint — Docker HEALTHCHECK and orchestrators need it.

Wrap async handlers or use express-async-errors, then end with a 4-arg middleware:
```js
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err);
  res.status(500).json({ ralat: "dalaman" });
});
```
Unhandled rejections crash the process — also add `process.on("unhandledRejection")` logging as a backstop.

